### List users (12, each with stats)
GET http://localhost:4000/users

### One user
GET http://localhost:4000/users/3

### Unknown user -> 404
GET http://localhost:4000/users/999

### Create user -> 201
POST http://localhost:4000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Student",
  "major": "Software Engineering",
  "semester": 4,
  "bio": "Just testing",
  "skills": ["React", "Node.js"]
}

### Invalid create -> 400 with details
POST http://localhost:4000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A", "semester": 12, "skills": [] }

### Update -> 200
PATCH http://localhost:4000/users/13
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bio": "Updated bio", "skills": ["React", "Node.js", "Express"] }

### Trying to edit the rating by hand does nothing
PATCH http://localhost:4000/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "average_rating": 5, "bio": "Rating field is ignored" }